  "description": "Receive webhooks from any provider (GitHub, Stripe, CI pipelines, monitoring tools) in your Claude Code session via Hookdeck. Hookdeck captures, inspects, and forwards webhook events to Claude with stable URLs, event replay, and filtering — no tunnel setup required.",
